dth="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Opening Balances</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-5">The building's balances at the takeover date, from the previous manager's balance sheet. Each fund's balance sheet must come to its opening balance, and the total must equal the two funds. Enter zero for a new building with no balances.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5 mb-6"><div><label for="takeoverDate" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Takeover date<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="takeoverDate" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise py-2.5" type="date" value=""><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The date the balances are struck at.</p></div><div><label for="totalBalance" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Total opening balance<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="totalBalance" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0.00" class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise text-right tabular-nums py-2.5" value=""></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-3">Administrative fund</h3><div class="space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><label for="admin-cash" class