efore signing off the cutover.</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Lot Balances<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Lot Opening Balances</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-5">What each owner owes at the takeover date: the levies and the interest owing in each fund, as shown in the previous manager's handover. Unallocated is money an owner has paid that is not yet applied to a levy: it is held as a credit in the administrative fund. Type the amounts as the handover prints them: a minus sign is fine (Urbanise shows an amount owing as -250.12), because each column already says whether the amount is owed or a credit.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-co