 tabular-nums">$0.00</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right tabular-nums">$0.00</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right tabular-nums">$0.00</td></tr></tfoot></table></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8l4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Next: Review<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Review &amp; Create</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-6">Check the details below, then create the property.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:p